    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guide the Silly Cat &quot;Momo-chan&quot; to the Goal!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momo-chan is a silly cat who can't do anything. She can't attack enemies or perform special actions\u2014all she can do is move! But that's exactly what makes this game fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Rules!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Momo-chan collides with an enemy, hits an obstacle, or falls off the course, it's <strong>game over</strong>, and you'll have to restart from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the stages, you'll find cat cans that affect your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Green Can</strong> \u2192 +1 point<br>\ud83d\udd35 <strong>Blue Can</strong> \u2192 +5 points<br>\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Red Can</strong> \u2192 +10 points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The timer starts counting up when the game begins. Your final score is determined by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elapsed Time - Total Cat Cans Collected</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your final score is <strong>0 or higher</strong>, you clear the stage!<br>If it's negative, it's <strong>game over</strong>, and you'll have to try again!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Yet Deep!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>20-stage action game</strong> that starts off easy but gets progressively harder!<br>By the end, you'll be facing <strong>super challenging stages</strong> that will put your skills to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide Momo-chan to victory?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guide the Silly Cat &quot;Momo-chan&quot; to the Goal!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momo-chan is a silly cat who can't do anything. She can't attack enemies or perform special actions\u2014all she can do is move! But that's exactly what makes this game fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Rules!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Momo-chan collides with an enemy, hits an obstacle, or falls off the course, it's <strong>game over</strong>, and you'll have to restart from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the stages, you'll find cat cans that affect your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Green Can</strong> \u2192 +1 point<br>\ud83d\udd35 <strong>Blue Can</strong> \u2192 +5 points<br>\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Red Can</strong> \u2192 +10 points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The timer starts counting up when the game begins. Your final score is determined by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elapsed Time - Total Cat Cans Collected</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your final score is <strong>0 or higher</strong>, you clear the stage!<br>If it's negative, it's <strong>game over</strong>, and you'll have to try again!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Yet Deep!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>20-stage action game</strong> that starts off easy but gets progressively harder!<br>By the end, you'll be facing <strong>super challenging stages</strong> that will put your skills to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide Momo-chan to victory?</p>",
    "short_description": "Momo is a silly cat who can only move! Avoid enemies and collect cat food cans to reach the goal. If you hit an obstacle or fall, it's game over! Your score is cans collected minus time elapsed. Clear all 20 stages in this simple yet challenging action game. Can you lead Momo to victory?",
